      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON THE WHISPER (4) goes very well here starting five times for two wins and two minors. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (18.87) in a Grade 4/5 last time at Q Straight. Looks a leading chance on best. BUNDY ALL GO (1) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (19.97) at this track. Has a win and four minor placings from five starts from this draw. Leading player again. TEMPO AND TOUCH (2) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.5 lengths second (20.11) behind In Her Wake at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Can measure up. HOOKED ON MAGIC (3) is not to be discarded.",
